<p> August	    35/50 P	August	  35/50 P</p>
<p> Sept	     95/110 P	Sept	   95/110 P</p>
<p>Soymeal/Pellets (dollars per short tonne 48 pct profat)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> July		25/20 D	July	    25/20 D</p>
<p> August	    19/18 D	August	  19/18 D</p>
<p> Sept	     EVEN/1 P	Sept	   EVEN/1 P</p>
<p> Oct		 16/19 P	Oct	     16/19 P</p>
